                    8. History         

v2.5   * new command: TASKS - shows tasks & her process-id
       * new command: ChangeTaskPri - changes priority of tasks
       * Type doesn't worked on V2.4x .. no it works (& even faster :) )
       * wildcards can be used now with PLAY and VIEW
       * copy/delete/move: filenames are shown (wildcards!)
       * redirection of output to file (or NIL: / NUL: for no output)

v2.44  * ALIAS-command
       * Executing a batch from a batch will work now.
       * SET UNIX ON to convert / to \ in commandlines
       * MEM shows free memory in bytes
       * INFO shows Infos about devices
       * new in PROMPT: %F shows free memory
                            
v2.43  * New LDIR-Command .. lists file-date,time&attribute
       * New ed_bat.als in the archive
       
v2.42  * RUN opo-files
       * ststistics in DIR and SDIR
       * no CD-try on 'unknown command'

v2.41  * Play doesn't played the given filename
       * CD is no longer needed
       

